(7746561, 1278903, 89774, '<td valign="top">Great shot. For me, if it had been cropped on the left, up to that first tree, it would have pulled my focus more to the person, and I would have loved for the person to have been looking more into the scene, rather than out (maybe by rotating 45 degrees to their right).</td>', 'Great shot. For me, if it had been cropped on the left, up to that first tree, it would have pulled my focus more to the person, and I would have loved for the person to have been looking more into the scene, rather than out (maybe by rotating 45 degrees to their right).', '2023-05-29 12:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7746562, 1278668, 140305, '<td valign="top">Strong image, these trees look as though they''ve survived some tough times!</td>', 'Strong image, these trees look as though they''ve survived some tough times!', '2023-05-29 12:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
