(7747976, 1279156, 67145, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous .. <br/>a perfect image for the challenge .. <br/>i hear what ppl say about the sky .. but in some ways it works .. there are no amazing clouds to distract from the story of the girl and the tree .. <br/>it looks a bit like a dull day .. but there is the child on the swing .. taking me back to times i lost myself in those moments .. <br/>a dull day becomes magic .. which is a message in itself .. <br/>i''m loving the foreground too with the grass and suggestion of flowers .. <br/>this is a wonderful and precious image .. <br/>congratulations on the blue .. <br/>btw . when i saw this with the blue i fully expected to see a score of mid 7''s .. and with pride of place on your profile page .. :)<br/></td>', 'absolutely gorgeous .. a perfect image for the challenge .. i hear what ppl say about the sky .. but in some ways it works .. there are no amazing clouds to distract from the story of the girl and the tree .. it looks a bit like a dull day .. but there is the child on the swing .. taking me back to times i lost myself in those moments .. a dull day becomes magic .. which is a message in itself .. i''m loving the foreground too with the grass and suggestion of flowers .. this is a wonderful and precious image .. congratulations on the blue .. btw . when i saw this with the blue i fully expected to see a score of mid 7''s .. and with pride of place on your profile page .. :)', '2023-06-05 19:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
